```

Sort ascending.

| Comparison | Action | List |
|---|---|---|
| 5 and 2 | swap | [2, 5, 4, 1] |
| 5 and 4 | swap | [2, 4, 5, 1] |
| 5 and 1 | swap | [2, 4, 1, 5] |

After first pass:

```text
