## 19. Optimized Bubble Sort

Bubble sort can stop early if no swaps occur in a pass.

### Pseudocode

```text
swapped ← true

WHILE swapped = true
    swapped ← false

    FOR index ← 0 TO length(items) - 2
        IF items[index] > items[index + 1] THEN
            temp ← items[index]
            items[index] ← items[index + 1]
            items[index + 1] ← temp
            swapped ← true
        ENDIF
    ENDFOR
ENDWHILE
```

### Why Useful?

If no swaps happen, the list is already sorted.

